From 09c25155483767d140aacf77ad2f8d9eda73a3fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adedayo Agarau <adedayoagarau@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Feb 2026 03:41:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: purge hardcoded data, expand orchestrator tools,
 fix ingestion paths
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Remove all hardcoded fallback data from agents (politician profiles,
  representatives, promises, election candidates) — all user-facing data
  now comes exclusively from database queries
- Expand orchestrator from 4 to 14 tools with compound query support
- Rewrite nigerian_politics.py to query Issue/Politician/NewsArticle
  tables instead of static dictionaries
- Enhance financial_intelligence.py with ILIKE fuzzy matching and
  auto year detection
- Fix hardcoded /Volumes paths in ingest_opentreasury.py,
  ingest_intelligence.py, and ingest_gap_data.py to use relative paths
- Add unified ingest_all_financial_data.py script for findings,
  OpenTreasury transactions, and budget data

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
