- search_financials: switch from AND to OR logic with relevance
  scoring so "Lagos education" finds records matching EITHER keyword
- get_state_financial_summary: auto-detect most recent year with
  data instead of defaulting to current year (2026 has no data)
- community_pulse: now includes financial_snapshot (budget totals,
  findings, transaction volume) for any state briefing
- accountability_scorecard: now includes financial intelligence
  for the politician's jurisdiction (anomalies, budget, transactions)
- lookup_politician_profile: enriched with recent news, issues
  involvement, and financial flags from their jurisdiction
- search_rag_news_and_context: auto-enriches with financial context
- election_prep: includes state budget context for voters
- System prompt updated to tell Tade about data intelligence layer

